<title>INDIA: Indian Sept industrial output up 9.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian Sept industrial output up 9.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 9.7 percent in September over the same month in 1995, the government said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Sep 96    Aug 96    Sep 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +9.7     +12.5     +12.6</p>
<p>     -Mining			 -1.4	-3.3	-3.3</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing	     +12.1     +16.2     +16.1</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +3.7	+3.3	+7.4</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  303.9     302.3     277.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for September 1996 are preliminary. Figures for August 1996 have been revised.  </p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE IND PRODUCTION    Apr-Sep 96    Apr-Sep 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	     +9.8	    +12.1</p>
<p>     -Mining			    +0.5	    +11.2</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		  +12.4	    +12.5</p>
<p>     -Electricity		     +2.8	    +10.9</p>
<p> Index (base 100=1980/81)	  289.7	    263.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for September 1996 are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
